-- =====================================================
-- MEASUREMENT SAFEGUARDS
-- =====================================================

-- Customer identities are distinct customer_unique_id
-- values represented in the selected order population.

-- Repeat ordering means more than one order by a
-- customer identity within the current filter context.

-- Review Coverage Rate uses order-level has_review_record,
-- not review-creation-date activity.

-- Average Review Score is review-record weighted.

-- High-Rating Review Share counts reviews with scores
-- 4 and 5 among reviews with valid scores.

-- Written Feedback Availability uses review-record grain:
-- a review has a title and/or message.

-- Monthly review measures refer to the associated
-- order's purchase month, not review creation month.

-- Review Date is not used as a slicer on this page.

-- Product and Seller filters are not added:
-- these dimensions do not automatically filter
-- customer and review facts in the approved model.


